        "title": "Grading System",
        "html": "<div class=\"lesson-content\">\n  <p class=\"lesson-intro\">Assessment tests not memorization, but the ability to apply knowledge in practice.</p>\n\n  <section class=\"lesson-section\">\n    <h2>Final grade structure</h2>\n    <div class=\"lesson-table-scroll\">\n      <table>\n        <tr><th>Component</th><th>What it assesses</th><th>Weight</th></tr>\n        <tr><td>Weekly mini-quizzes</td><td>Mastery of each module's theory</td><td>20%</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Lab reports</td><td>Practical skills and quality of write-up</td><td>35%</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Midterm assignment (after wk. 6)</td><td>Integrated application of blocks 1–2</td><td>15%</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Capstone project (wk. 12)</td><td>Full skill cycle plus report</td><td>30%</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"lesson-section\">\n    <h2>Grading scale</h2>\n    <div class=\"lesson-table-scroll\">\n      <table>\n        <tr><th>Score</th><th>Level</th><th>What it means</th></tr>\n        <tr><td>90–100</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Solves tasks independently, explains \"why,\" ready for a junior role</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>75–89</td><td>Good</td><td>Performs confidently following a model, minor gaps remain</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>60–74</td><td>Satisfactory</td><td>Basic skills are present, needs support and repetition</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>&lt;60</td><td>Fail</td><td>Module retake required</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"lesson-section\">\n    <h2>Lab report rubric (uniform for all practicals)</h2>\n    <div class=\"lesson-table-scroll\">\n      <table>\n        <tr><th>Criterion</th><th>What is checked</th><th>Max. points</th></tr>\n        <tr><td>Completeness</td><td>All lab steps completed, objectives achieved</td><td>30</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Correctness</td><td>Findings and conclusions are technically accurate</td><td>25</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Evidence</td><td>Screenshots/logs support the result</td><td>15</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Analysis and explanation</td><td>Student explains the cause of the vulnerability and its risk</td><td>15</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Remediation recommendations</td><td>Adequate mitigation measures proposed</td><td>10</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Formatting and ethics</td><td>Well-structured; legal framework observed</td><td>5</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"lesson-section\">\n    <h2>Lab report template (mandatory submission format)</h2>\n    <ol>\n      <li><strong>Objective</strong> — what was done and why.</li>\n      <li><strong>Environment and tools</strong> — where it was performed (lab, platform, software).</li>\n      <li><strong>Procedure</strong> — step-by-step actions.</li>\n      <li><strong>Findings</strong> — what was discovered, with evidence (screenshots/logs).</li>\n      <li><strong>Risk assessment</strong> — severity of each finding (low/medium/high).</li>\n      <li><strong>Recommendations</strong> — how to remediate/protect against it.</li>\n      <li><strong>Conclusion</strong> — brief summary and what was learned.</li>\n      <li><strong>Ethics confirmation</strong> — work was carried out only in an authorized environment.</li>\n    </ol>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"lesson-section\">\n    <h2>Capstone project criteria</h2>\n    <div class=\"lesson-table-scroll\">\n      <table>\n        <tr><th>Criterion</th><th>Description</th><th>Weight</th></tr>\n        <tr><td>Methodology</td><td>Logical, complete cycle (reconnaissance → … → report)</td><td>25%</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Technical result</td><td>Actual issues found/resolved</td><td>30%</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Report quality</td><td>Professional write-up following the template</td><td>20%</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Risk assessment and recommendations</td><td>Sound prioritization and defense measures</td><td>15%</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Defense of the work</td><td>Ability to explain their decisions</td><td>10%</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n"
